# The real contents of this directory are build output: the Docker build drops
# the Vite bundle here before compiling, and `make ui` does the same locally.
# Only the placeholder page is tracked, so `go build ./...` works without Node.
#
# After `make ui` the placeholder will show as modified — `make ui-reset` puts
# it back.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
